// The single source for every key binding and every place that documents
// one: the help panel, the status-line hint, the key ticker, the search-bar
// hint line and README's "Keys" section (regenerated by `pnpm run docs`;
// tests/docs.test.js fails when it is stale). Change keys here only.
//
// In `keys`, `summary` and `help`, text in backticks renders as <kbd>.

